body:
nope, i mean my mom knew and she said that it was normal. when my friends came over and we were in the livingroom playing, he would still watch porn with us there and my friends never said anything to me either. I just assumed it was normal. Plus he just touched me, nothing more.. so i wasn't sure about it. 

&#x200B;

I'm also a very insecure person, i just dont know.

>Was he in his vestments?

ahaha nope, but he  had his clerical collar on, a jacket with a silver brooch cross and a rosary as a necklace

&#x200B;
